  -1 0 + i>i32 -1 i>i32 1 check32 dup if return then drop
  30000 0 + i>u32 30000 i>i32 2 check32 dup if return then drop
  123456 i>i32 100000 i>i32 i32- i32>i 23456 3 checkw dup if return then drop

